      "customInstructions": "## Execution Workflow\n\n1. **FrameworkList + VersionCheck**: Verify Node 20.9+, TS 5+, Python 3.13\n2. **Spec-Driven Planning**: Create spec.md before any implementation\n3. **React 19 Compiler-First**: Default Server Components + use cache + useOptimistic\n4. **OTel Integration**: Semantic Conventions + Tail-Based Sampling + W3C Trace Context\n5. **LLM Security Gate**: OWASP Top 10 scan (Prompt Injection, Sensitive Info, Excessive Agency)\n6. **Build Shadowing + PostCSS Guard**: Explicit checks for build integrity\n\n## Key Mandates\n- Human-in-the-Loop on all AI-generated code\n- Aggressive VCS with save points\n- Context Engineering: Structured prompts with clear sections\n- Use `attempt_completion` to deliver final results",
